{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"29a2f3388c6d894893ceb7f0a1bcd9981043088082b822c58eceb0c396ab0a00","slug":"shell-script","location":"/012-shell_script.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"쉘스크립트","content_includes_title":true,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"SeungGyu Bak","given":"SeungGyu","family":"Bak"},"name":"SeungGyu Bak","email":"seunggyu.bak@gmail.com","affiliations":["Korean National Police University"],"id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0","corresponding":true}],"github":"https://github.com/esoterikosQ/QLab_book","affiliations":[{"id":"Korean National Police University","name":"Korean National Police University"}],"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"source_url":"https://github.com/esoterikosQ/QLab_book/blob/master/012-shell_script.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/esoterikosQ/QLab_book/edit/master/012-shell_script.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"012-shell_script.md","url":"/build/012-shell_script-85717f125a00649bf116782509a60672.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"쉘스크립트","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"NSuLUR3UL3"}],"identifier":"id","label":"쉘스크립트","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"YsCmtWOO8b"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"쉘스크립트(Shell Script)는 유닉스 셸(Unix Shell)에서 실행되는 명령어들의 모음입니다. 쉘스크립트를 사용하면 반복적인 작업을 자동화하고, 시스템 관리 작업을 간소화할 수 있습니다. 쉘스크립트는 일반적으로 ","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"RMrKnxwd0B"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".sh","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"rdB1fcNrJy"},{"type":"text","value":" 확장자를 가지며, 텍스트 에디터를 이용하여 작성하는 것이 가장 수월하고, 프롬프트 상에서 touch 명령을 이용하여 직접 작성할 수도 있습니다. 쉘스크립트는 다양한 쉘 환경에서 실행될 수 있으며, 가장 널리 사용되는 쉘은 Bash(Bourne Again SHell)입니다. 쉘스크립트를 작성할 때는 다음과 같은 기본 구문을 사용합니다:","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"gVLNO25aI3"}],"key":"sVelsVTX4q"},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","value":"#!/bin/bash\n# 이 스크립트는 \"Hello, World!\"를 출력합니다.\necho \"Hello, World!\"","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"key":"gvXIPDih4a"},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","value":"# 실행\nchmod +x script.sh # 스크립트를 실행하려면 실행할 수 있도록 권한을 부여해야 합니다.\n./script.sh","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1},"end":{"line":15,"column":1}},"key":"H1nQsoSzD9"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"쉘스크립트를 이용하면 반복적으로 이용하는 명령어를 하나의 세트로 묶어서 한 명령어처럼 실행할 수 있습니다.","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":1},"end":{"line":17,"column":1}},"key":"QqoysKIer9"}],"key":"Vwx3hFTQEd"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"변수 사용","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":1},"end":{"line":19,"column":1}},"key":"VcZHMdfcEu"}],"identifier":"id","label":"변수 사용","html_id":"id-1","implicit":true,"key":"fpzAlEmsll"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"쉘스크립트에서 변수를 사용하여 값을 저장하고 재사용할 수 있습니다. 변수는 ","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"fL72VAmay5"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"$","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"FrpZqblIUM"},{"type":"text","value":" 기호를 사용하여 참조합니다.","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1},"end":{"line":21,"column":1}},"key":"KHYHiVG98o"}],"key":"lMCgBuL84O"},{"type":"code","lang":"bash","value":"#!/bin/bash\nNAME=\"Alice\"\necho \"Hello, $NAME!\"","position":{"start":{"line":23,"column":1},"end":{"line":27,"column":1}},"key":"Idtj6YjTen"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":29,"colum